  <data name="About_Note1" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Hi, I'm Quinten. I built DispHub because I kept opening three different control panels just to make a game look right or to make my screen easier on the eyes at night. I wanted one small, quiet app that does it properly and looks like it belongs on Windows.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="About_Note2" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>DispHub is made by one person, in spare time, with a lot of care. If it makes your screen a little nicer to look at, that means a lot. Ideas and bug reports are always welcome on GitHub; I read every one.</value>
  </data>
